{"id":"n93420-1-9","stage":4,"title":"한자어 · 汉字词","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n93420-1-9-1","ko":"외국인들이 한국어를 배울 때 무엇을 어려워하나요?","zh":"外国人在学习韩语时，觉得什么最难呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"외국인들이","meaning":"外国人","explanation":"외국인：外国人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"외국인","audio":"/audio/82d761d8dbb723689c37.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26210","senseId":"1","lemma":"외국인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한국어를","meaning":"韩国语，韩语","explanation":"한국어：韩国语，韩语；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한국어","audio":"/audio/ea3252281bc3bcec5672.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26910","senseId":"1","lemma":"한국어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배울","meaning":"学，学习","explanation":"배우다：学，学习；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"배우다","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62088","senseId":"1","lemma":"배우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"무엇을","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇：什么；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"무엇","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17199","senseId":"1","lemma":"무엇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어려워하나요?","meaning":"觉得难","explanation":"어려워하다：觉得难；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"어려워하다","audio":"/audio/6631454d8fd03b919f10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70483","senseId":"2","lemma":"어려워하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"82d761d8dbb72368","term":"외국인","zh":"外国人","audio":"/audio/82d761d8dbb723689c37.mp3","entryId":"26210","definition":"其他国家的人。","pronunciation":["외ː구긴","웨ː구긴"]},{"id":"ea3252281bc3bcec","term":"한국어","zh":"韩国语，韩语","audio":"/audio/ea3252281bc3bcec5672.mp3","entryId":"26910","definition":"韩国使用的语言。","pronunciation":["한ː구거"]},{"id":"2c65351237177855","term":"배우다","zh":"学，学习","audio":"/audio/2c65351237177855703f.mp3","entryId":"62088","definition":"获得新知识。","pronunciation":["배우다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"c95167f3fe21887b","term":"무엇","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/c95167f3fe21887b7320.mp3","entryId":"17199","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["무얻"]},{"id":"6631454d8fd03b91","term":"어려워하다","zh":"觉得难","audio":"/audio/6631454d8fd03b919f10.mp3","entryId":"70483","definition":"觉得不易做或觉得累。","pronunciation":["어려워하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e69e899b580028ef9852.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n93420-1-9-2","ko":"네, 어휘의 경우 한자어를 많이 어려워합니다.","zh":"是的，就词汇而言，他们觉得汉字词特别难。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어휘의","meaning":"词汇","explanation":"어휘：词汇；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"어휘","audio":"/audio/df1b33bc83ac7a2b1c30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67144","senseId":"1","lemma":"어휘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"경우","meaning":"境遇，情况","explanation":"경우：境遇，情况","readings":[{"term":"경우","audio":"/audio/0925aa90ecffa7d68ff7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61524","senseId":"2","lemma":"경우","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한자어를","meaning":"汉字词","explanation":"한자어：汉字词；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"한자어","audio":"/audio/f67f73f77138455aaa14.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"93420","senseId":"1","lemma":"한자어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dic